<title>HONDURAS: HONDURAS WEEKLY COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE - IHCAFE.</title>
<headline>HONDURAS WEEKLY COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE - IHCAFE.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA, Honduras 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduran Coffee Institute updated on Tuesday coffee exports and sales to Aug 5 in the 1996-1997 Oct-Sept cycle. Figures are in 46-kg bags, known as quintals. Data from the previous 1995-1996 cycle are to the same date.</p>
<p>    Transactions	   1995-1996	  1996-1997     Change</p>
<p>    Registered Purchases 2,465,314	  2,616,499    151,185</p>
<p>    Registered Sales     2,666,020	  2,391,437   -274,583</p>
<p>    Exports		  2,635,095	  2,369,805   -265,290</p>
<p>((--Tegucigalpa bureau +504 39 28 85))</p>
</text>
